{"unit_id":"yangyongzhen__dsh-git-workflow#card-zh","repo":"yangyongzhen/dsh-git-workflow","commit":"a7c2a9c7bdd65e0e89358cce1f6e38dc7e3d66d2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-git-workflow 是面向 DSH 的 Git 工作流插件，通过注册五个模型可调用工具，在会话工作目录或指定目录中操作 Git 仓库。它可以查看分支、上游同步状态和文件变更，按 Conventional Commits 规则提交代码，按提交类型生成 Markdown changelog，并根据分支差异生成 PR 标题与描述模板；还可以把当前分支推送到远端并设置上游。适合希望在 DSH 对话中整理提交、准备 PR 或推送分支的开发者。需要本机可调用 git，并在目标目录中提供 Git 仓库；不需要平台 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37-140","lib/git.js:68-129","lib/git.js:151-260","lib/git.js:265-271"]}
{"unit_id":"yangyongzhen__dsh-git-workflow#card-en","repo":"yangyongzhen/dsh-git-workflow","commit":"a7c2a9c7bdd65e0e89358cce1f6e38dc7e3d66d2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-git-workflow adds five Git tools to DSH: inspect status, create Conventional Commits, write changelogs, draft PR summaries, and push branches. It works in the session workspace or a configured directory. A local git executable and repository are required; no hosting API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:37-140","lib/git.js:68-129","lib/git.js:151-260","lib/git.js:265-271"]}
